Choose the plugin license and put its complete license text here. The manifest's `license` field must use a valid SPDX expression and match this file. For non-MIT expressions, start with `SPDX-License-Identifier: <expression>` and include the complete text for every selected license. For MIT, use the complete MIT text and replace its copyright holder with the plugin's actual rights holder. The repository root LICENSE covers the template scaffolding and does not license this plugin package.
